# People vouched for (or denounced) as contributors to oschmod.
#
# Pull requests from people who aren't listed here are closed automatically
# (see .github/workflows/vouch-check-pr.yml). Collaborators with write access
# and bots are always allowed. Issues are open to everyone.
#
# To vouch for someone, add their GitHub username on its own line in a PR.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md ("Getting vouched").
#
# Syntax (https://github.com/mitchellh/vouch):
#  - One handle per line (without @), sorted alphabetically.
#  - Optional platform prefix (default github): github:username
#  - Denounce with a leading minus: -username, optionally followed by
#    a reason. Denounced users are always blocked.
